Package: IsoNetAnalyzeR
Title: Isoform-Level Protein Interaction Network Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nikolas", "Mumm", , "s242825@dtu.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for isoform-level protein interaction network
    analysis, with a focus on how alternative splicing reshapes protein
    interaction landscapes. Core functionality includes virtual pulldown
    simulations, differential pulldown analysis across splicing conditions,
    connected component analysis, and gene set enrichment and
    over-representation analysis (GSEA/ORA) on network topology statistics.
    Developed as part of a master's thesis at the Technical University
    of Denmark (DTU).
